Vault in Kubernetes
Lab Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Install and configure HashiCorp Vault on Kubernetes
Set up Kubernetes authentication for Vault
Configure Vault to inject secrets into Kubernetes pods
Deploy applications that consume secrets from Vault
Understand the security benefits of using Vault for secret management in Kubernetes
Troubleshoot common Vault-Kubernetes integration issues
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, you should have:

Basic understanding of Kubernetes concepts (pods, services, deployments)
Familiarity with YAML configuration files
Basic knowledge of Linux command line operations
Understanding of container concepts and Docker
Basic knowledge of secret management concepts
